ns data of unexpected shape.) \r\n\r\nThis behaviour is [documented](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/jax.experimental.host_callback.html?highlight=host_callback#low-level-details-and-debugging) as a limitation of the `call` implementation on TPUs, but it is nevertheless a significant usability bug. \r\n\r\n(On CPU and GPU the infeed can be interrupted, e.g., by sending data of wrong shape. The TPU infeed mechanism does not do error checking.) ","closed_at":"2023-11-13T11:19:27Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890983?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnecula","id":3890983,"login":"gnecula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA5ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6621/comments","created_at":"2021-05-03T14:39:22Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6621/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/6621","id":874633878,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0